<h1 id="summary">Summary</h1>

<ol>
  <li>Writing SwiftUI feels like when I first touched UIKit — hard at the beginning, because I lack understanding of it.</li>
  <li>SwiftUI’s framework design should have taken this kind of problem into account and provided a dedicated API, or at least Xcode’s suggestions shouldn’t be wrong. When even what Xcode provides is wrong, it only shows that the thing isn’t mature yet.</li>
</ol>

